  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The recent addition of the allow menu, the one where one may alter instance settings such as \"Allow emojis, \"Allow stickers\", etc., harms the user experience of creating an instance. In most cases, people do not want to alter them, so the presence of this menu presents an extra pointless click for such cases which increases the friction of making a new instance. Please move these settings to an instance settings button one has to explicitly enter, such as illustrated below. This would also allow one to alter the settings after selecting them before placing a portal, should they wish to do so.",
